@startuml act_kpi_recompute
title Activity — KPI Recomputation

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam activityBorderColor #808080
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam noteBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA

start

:Triggering event\n(workload entry, milestone update, mission or amendment);

:Load the project's data\n(TCC, workload plan, actual workload, milestones, missions);

:Compute the actual labor cost\n(Σ actual days × daily TCC rate);

:Estimate the final project cost (EAC);

if (EAC > initial budget?) then (yes)
  :Flag the budget drift;
else (no)
  :Compute the projected margin\n((budget − EAC) / budget);
endif

:Compute billing progress\n(invoiced amount / total budget);

:Update the project's KPI dashboard;

stop

note right
  Recomputed on every read; nothing is written until the monthly snapshot.
end note

@enduml
